        "currentness_limit_hours": 14,
        "currentness_rationale": "IFS Open Data is released at the end of the real-time dissemination schedule. Around cycle transitions the preceding public run can legitimately exceed 12 h age; a 14 h limit covers the documented dissemination window with a small margin while retaining a strict freshness gate.",
